From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 11:53:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] platform: add a V1 sampler platform hook

What: Adds Platform.get_sampler(logprobs_mode, use_fp64_gumbel) (default
  None); GPUModelRunner uses the returned sampler and falls back to the
  upstream Sampler when it is None.
Why: Out-of-tree platforms (the vllm-sm70 plugin) need to swap in a
  Volta top-k candidate sampler (Flint sampler, K16) for the V1 runner;
  the sampler is built only at vllm/v1/worker/gpu_model_runner.py:563.
Upstream-files: vllm/platforms/interface.py, vllm/v1/worker/gpu_model_runner.py
Kill-switch: hook returns None -> upstream (no plugin, or VLLM_SM70_FLINT_SAMPLER=0)
Tests: sm70/tests/plugin/test_u4_sampler_hook.py
Upstream-status: candidate

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011nZrmUQtD6qJskP867jP1x

diff --git a/vllm/platforms/interface.py b/vllm/platforms/interface.py
index 31b35de88f45..24a3088ddf38 100644
--- a/vllm/platforms/interface.py
+++ b/vllm/platforms/interface.py
@@ -1218,6 +1218,11 @@ class Platform:
         for upstream."""
         return None
 
+    @classmethod
+    def get_sampler(cls, logprobs_mode: str, use_fp64_gumbel: bool) -> Any:
+        """Return a platform V1 Sampler, or None for upstream."""
+        return None
+
     @classmethod
     def get_punica_wrapper(cls) -> str:
         """Return the punica wrapper for current platform."""
diff --git a/vllm/v1/worker/gpu_model_runner.py b/vllm/v1/worker/gpu_model_runner.py
index ac3ff3b65865..556481724e36 100644
--- a/vllm/v1/worker/gpu_model_runner.py
+++ b/vllm/v1/worker/gpu_model_runner.py
@@ -560,7 +560,10 @@ class GPUModelRunner(
         self._pp_recv_work: torch.distributed.Work | None = None
 
         # Sampler
-        self.sampler = Sampler(
+        self.sampler = current_platform.get_sampler(
+            logprobs_mode=self.model_config.logprobs_mode,
+            use_fp64_gumbel=self.model_config.use_fp64_gumbel,
+        ) or Sampler(
             logprobs_mode=self.model_config.logprobs_mode,
             use_fp64_gumbel=self.model_config.use_fp64_gumbel,
         )
